teachers with funny tricks, and make the classroom a chaotic playground.\n\nFLIP THE CLASSROOM\n\nKnock over desks, throw students and teachers around, and watch the hilarious reactions. From slapping pranks to over-the-top mayhem, nothing is off-limits in your mission to create total disorder.\n{931255579317179}\n\n\nDRINK THE GIANT POTION\n\nGrab the magical potion and watch yourself grow into a towering giant! Smash through desks, lift classmates and teachers.\n\n{1667556514258190}\n\nPURE FUN AND LAUGHTER\nI\u2019m a Rascal! is all about hilarious moments, chaos, and over-the-top mischief. Are you ready to cause mayhem in the classroom? \n\n\n\n{648534651686094}", "short_description": "Step into the chaos as a mischievous student! Throw apples, prank teachers, blast noises, grow huge with magic potions, and toss classmates around. Pure classroom mayhem awaits in I\u2019m a Rascal!"}]}, "developer_name": "JB Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/vrprivacy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "JB Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/vrprivacy/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26629498699969112"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1423004426391981"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id"